    "title": "PS22477 - Report on the core principles and opportunities for trustworthy and responsible AI",
    "description": "***** THIS IS AN AWARD NOTICE, NOT A CALL FOR COMPETITION *****\r\nThis procurement is being concluded following a competitive procurement exercise.\r\n\r\nBrief Description of Requirement\r\n\r\nThe aim of this tender exercise is to appoint a supplier for the provision of the research \r\nand writing of a report on the Core principles and opportunities for trustworthy and \r\nresponsible AI. The output of this work is split into 2 phases. Phase 1 makes the backbone of the work and is linked with submission of the interim report. Phase 2, constitutes with finalising the report, revisions and final edits.",
